  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/739",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><br><br>온도측정</span>은 흥미로운 실험이죠.<br></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61436b565fe0dd6160fd5ed0fec193d3f94ea21e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/61436b565fe0dd6160fd5ed0fec193d3f94ea21e\" data-origin-width=\"706\" data-origin-height=\"515\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">마깨비</span><br><br></span></b><br><b>이 무서운 녀석과 함께한다면</b><br><b>더욱 무시무시한....</b><br><b>......</b><br><b>이 아닌 ㅋㅋ<br></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">자동 그래프 생성을 실현</span>하는</b><br><b>지능형 과학교사가 되는 겁니다!!!! </b><br><b>여러분~!!!!</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>오홋!</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b>함, 담가봐? 발을?&#160;</b><b>하신다면....</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b>아래 1편에서 </b><br><b>김장 한판하고 오시면&#160;^O^</b><br><b><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/738\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/738</a></b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br><b>신에게는 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">2가지 선택지</span>가 있사옵니다.</b><br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">1. 내장형 온도계 사용</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">2. 외장형 온도계 사용</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5f0d812764841eda0237cb1372b31eecbc0191b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5f0d812764841eda0237cb1372b31eecbc0191b\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">왼쪽에 보이시나요?</span></b><br>&#160;<br><b>컴퓨터나 휴대폰에 </b><b>가끔</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">&quot;니 폰이 너무 뜨거워, 폰 좀 고만할래?&quot; ^^;;</span></b><br><b>하는 과열 알림이 뜨기도 하잖아요. ㅋㅋ</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>그런게 다 </b><br><b>이런 컴퓨터 같은 녀석들 본체 옆에</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">내장형 온도계가</span> 알려주는거라네요.</b><br>&#160;<br><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4bb971ef0e121514986548e06b6d73f8c9751a5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4bb971ef0e121514986548e06b6d73f8c9751a5\" data-origin-width=\"1529\" data-origin-height=\"758\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b>&lt;내장형 온도계&gt; 의 측정값을 보실 때는</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>갓동준 선생님의 </b><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">자바실험실 <br><br>&#39;측정 &gt; Javalab MBL&#39;</span> 의</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>오른쪽의 </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&lt;마이크로비트 MBL 무선 내장 온도계&gt;</span> <br>클릭~!</b><br><b><a href=\"https://www.javalab.org/microbit_mbl_intemp/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.javalab.org/microbit_mbl_intemp/</a></b><br><br><b>&#160;(PC나 폰 모두 가능하며, <br>폰은 안드로이드,<br>크롬 브라우져를 추천합니당)</b><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5c7f25f949e941881aad200c4359fbd8ad7a7a1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5c7f25f949e941881aad200c4359fbd8ad7a7a1\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b>딱 1번 하는<span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"> 프로그램 깔아주고,</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">배터리 ON! </span>하셨다면!</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4beb502efa581f969b2110f1bedd801f6d5b333\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4beb502efa581f969b2110f1bedd801f6d5b333\" data-origin-width=\"1235\" data-origin-height=\"568\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">&lt;Micro:bit 연결&gt;</span> 클릭!</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/78d6661fbc93f7d76d474fa45cbe23419fceb4c5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/78d6661fbc93f7d76d474fa45cbe23419fceb4c5\" data-origin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"691\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">페어링</span>하면</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce8542856024449f83db3c6a84eda20f2a58f82e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce8542856024449f83db3c6a84eda20f2a58f82e\" data-origin-width=\"1420\" data-origin-height=\"580\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b>사이트가 요로케~! 슝~! 바뀝니다!!!</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">손으로 </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&lt;내장형 온도계&gt; 에</span> </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">온기를 더해주면</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60e71363c91b77e8f2548f525847f9c8243fec46\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60e71363c91b77e8f2548f525847f9c8243fec46\" data-origin-width=\"1437\" data-origin-height=\"582\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b>온도가 올라가는 광경을!!!</b><br><b>목격하실 수 있으세요~!!!!!</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">끝!</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">내장형 끝!!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>자,&#160;</b><b>큰 산 하나 넘고</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">그런데 말입니다.</span></b><br><b>온도 측정을 하려면</b><br><b>물에 이걸 담그.....</b><br>&#160;<br><b>딱봐도 안될 것 같지요.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>그래서</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">신에게는 &lt;외장형 온도계&gt;가 있사옵니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a75edb7e122fb4195c743c56b5b1e843aa6cdbf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6a75edb7e122fb4195c743c56b5b1e843aa6cdbf\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b>후훗,&#160;</b><br><b>먼가 무시무시하게 또 생긴</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">연결판</span>이 있더랬죠.</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7eb8a45742786504b05e3c1c161c4aca10c1713b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7eb8a45742786504b05e3c1c161c4aca10c1713b\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br>그냥 <b>꽂으면 끝!</b><br><b>끝까지 <span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">힘주어 꽉! 끼우면</span> 끝입니다!</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07e81a6f03d25d29001f108914f53b83b97a7d42\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07e81a6f03d25d29001f108914f53b83b97a7d42\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><b>얘가 바로 </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">방수되는 &lt;외부형 온도계&gt; </span>인데요.</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">은색쪽</span>이 딱! </b><br><b>온도계로 보이는데</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>반대쪽 연결짹은 </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">참으로 화려한 색상</span>이 있네용 ㅠㅠ</b><br><b>저런거 무서운데....<br><br></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1b5bb44ab598b944c06aa69c7de2949a82a6137\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1b5bb44ab598b944c06aa69c7de2949a82a6137\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b>아까 꽉~! 꽂은 연결판에 </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">1번 줄에 &lt;세로&gt;로 딱~!</span> 꽂습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><br><b>단, 조심!!!!!! <span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">노빨검!!&#160;</span></b><br><b>예민하고 까다로운 놈 -_-;; </b><br><b>방향성이 있습니당!&#160;</b><br>&#160;(참사이언스몰꺼는 꽂는 거였는데 다른 온도계는 드라이버가 필요한 것도 있어요)<br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e38e502435984f27c392f023ce7a8b23e66bc81e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e38e502435984f27c392f023ce7a8b23e66bc81e\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">난 온도계 2개 쓰고싶다~!</span> 시면</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">세로로 2개 나란히</span> 꽂으시면 됩니다!</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc0fda35a4ea570f124179d35dee08f759cf2730\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc0fda35a4ea570f124179d35dee08f759cf2730\" data-origin-width=\"1529\" data-origin-height=\"758\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b>그럼, <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">자바실험실</span>로 모시겠습니다.</b><br>&#160;<br><b>왼쪽이 &lt;방수형 온도계&gt; 입니다.</b><br><b><a href=\"https://www.javalab.org/microbit_mbl_ds18b20/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.javalab.org/microbit_mbl_ds18b20/</a></b><br>&#160;<br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4dabc9b9c1146e3ec6ee46f59ab357de51c20180\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4dabc9b9c1146e3ec6ee46f59ab357de51c20180\" data-origin-width=\"1324\" data-origin-height=\"610\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><br><br><br>페어링</span>부터 해야겠찌요?</b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">OK! 익숙해졌으!<br><br></span></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6cfa1855f2611d9626dcca7cfd71d605c37a83d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6cfa1855f2611d9626dcca7cfd71d605c37a83d9\" data-origin-width=\"1468\" data-origin-height=\"702\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b>사이트가 요로코롬 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">마술같이</span> 바뀌면</b><br><b>온도계 2개 중 1개를 살콤 잡으니</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">템퍼러쳐가 각자의 길로</span> 벌어지네요!!!</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b>오호~!</b><br>&#160;<br><b>이제 그럼, </b><br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">끓는점 측정이랑 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">단열압축 실험할 때도 </span></b><br><b>요것만 있으면<span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"> 자동그래프 생성</span>이네요!</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><br><b>아.... 주사기 사고싶다;</b><br><b>보일 법칙도 하게</b><br><b>방학 전에 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">주사기</span> 사올껄....</b><br><b>ㅠㅅㅠ 아까비,</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br>&#160;<br><b>아직은 1월입니다.<br></b><br><b>헤헷</b><br><b>2월아 오지마라.</b><br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}